title: "Delft-dunite DARTS: a hypothetical hydrogen source and transport model"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Bert da Costa"
    given-names: "Sander"
abstract: >-
  Preliminary numerical support for a proposal combining established natural-hydrogen
  research methods. An ideal dunite source is inserted below a Delft-inspired
  sedimentary sequence. This is not a calibrated Delft hydrogen resource model.
